    "long_instructions": "## Plan Your Calculation\r\n\r\nUse AI Chat to help plan or check your custom calculator. Ask AI Chat to help you:\r\n\r\n- Decide what inputs your calculator needs\r\n- Choose the correct data type for each input\r\n- Create or check your formula\r\n- Plan what your output should tell the user\r\n",
